{"seq":54,"slug":"reinforcement-learning-applied","title":"强化学习工程应用","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied","rating":{"composite":4.1,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"强化学习工程应用\">强化学习工程应用</h1><p>强化学习（Reinforcement Learning, RL）在 2024-2026 年间经历了从学术研究到大规模工程落地的关键转折。RLHF 驱动了 ChatGPT、Claude 等对话系统的对齐训练，DPO 将偏好优化的计算成本降低了一个数量级，Offline RL 让安全敏感领域（医疗、自动驾驶、工业控制）首次实现了纯离线策略学习，而 Sim-to-Real 技术使得仿真训练的机器人策略能够零样本迁移到真实硬件上。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于 RL 从算法到工程产品的完整链路，覆盖基础理论、核心算法、行业应用与工程实践四个维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的分工\">与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>本 hub（强化学习工程应用）</strong>：关注 RL 算法在真实产品中的落地——RLHF/DPO 对齐管线、Offline RL 部署、Sim-to-Real 迁移、推荐系统中的序贯决策，以及支撑这些应用的训练基础设施与评估体系。</li>\n<li><strong>LLM 微调（<code>49_llm-fine-tuning</code>）</strong>：聚焦参数高效微调（LoRA/QLoRA）、数据工程与 Adapter 管理，RL 对齐仅作为其方法之一出现；本 hub 则深入 RL 对齐的算法细节与工程权衡。</li>\n<li><strong>自动驾驶（<code>46_autonomous-driving</code>）</strong>：覆盖感知、规划、仿真验证的全栈系统视角；本 hub 从 RL 算法视角切入自动驾驶中的规划与仿真迁移问题。</li>\n<li><strong>多臂老虎机（<code>26_multi-armed-bandits-online</code>）</strong>：处理探索-利用的单步决策问题；本 hub 处理多步序贯决策与长期回报优化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>路径 A（LLM 对齐工程师）</strong>：foundations → algorithms (RLHF/DPO) → engineering (训练基建 + 部署)</p>\n<p><strong>路径 B（机器人/自动驾驶工程师）</strong>：foundations → algorithms (Offline RL) → applications (Sim-to-Real) → engineering</p>\n<p><strong>路径 C（推荐/搜索工程师）</strong>：foundations → applications (推荐系统) → algorithms (Offline RL) → engineering (评估调试)</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>机器学习基础：梯度下降、神经网络训练、损失函数设计</li>\n<li>概率论：期望、条件概率、KL 散度</li>\n<li>Python 深度学习框架（PyTorch）的使用经验</li>\n<li>对 LLM 基础概念的了解（适用于路径 A）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"强化学习基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mdp-policy-gradient","title":"马尔可夫决策过程与策略梯度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/mdp-policy-gradient"},{"seq":2,"slug":"value-based-methods","title":"基于价值的方法与时序差分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/value-based-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reward-engineering","title":"奖励工程与信号设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/foundations/reward-engineering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"核心算法与对齐方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rlhf-ppo-alignment","title":"RLHF 与 PPO 对齐管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/algorithms/rlhf-ppo-alignment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dpo-preference-optimization","title":"DPO 直接偏好优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/algorithms/dpo-preference-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"offline-rl-cql","title":"离线强化学习与保守 Q 学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/algorithms/offline-rl-cql"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications","title":"行业应用场景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sim-to-real-robotics","title":"Sim-to-Real 机器人迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications/sim-to-real-robotics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recommendation-systems","title":"推荐系统中的序贯决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications/recommendation-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"game-ai-industrial","title":"游戏 AI 与工业控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/applications/game-ai-industrial"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践与生产部署","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"training-infrastructure","title":"训练基础设施与分布式系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/training-infrastructure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation-debugging","title":"评估调试与策略诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/evaluation-debugging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"production-deployment","title":"生产部署与在线服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/production-deployment"}]}]}